  "description": "MOTCUV01 crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H100 Dy4 N10 O24 2+,2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.492-3.838 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.01-109.91°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L1)4(μ3-O)2(NO3)2] (H2L1 = 6,6'-((1E,1'E)-(cyclohexane-1,3-diylbis(azanylylidene))bis(methanylylidene))bis(2-methoxyphenol)); EA C88H98Dy4N10O24. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
